{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.2022a.q32.material.recovered", "text": "下面是某位教师在教学“用对立统一的观点看问题”时的教学片段。（20分）辽沈战役是解放战争中具有决定意义的三大战役之一。毛泽东全面分析了敌我双方的情况后认为，虽然攻打锦州比攻打长春、沈阳要困难得多，但先攻占锦州是夺取这一战役胜利的关键。因为锦州是通向关内的咽喉，是东北敌人撤回关内的唯一路上通道，这里敌人消灭了，就可以把东北的大门堵死，关起门来歼灭东北的国民党军队。辽沈战役的胜利证明，这一决策是完全正确的。【师问】：（1）毛泽东为何提出先攻打锦州？（2）毛泽东提出先攻占锦州的战略决策的原因是什么？（3）结合生活事例，谈谈你在面对复杂事物时是如何看待主次矛盾的。【生答】：略", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "081b9980033e9d47fd37d7f84c27fdf5ac75ac8772b577954fd9eb8149bf38aa", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3793, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4080, "next_source_question_number": 33, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 32, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "081b9980033e9d47fd37d7f84c27fdf5ac75ac8772b577954fd9eb8149bf38aa"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.2022a.q32"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.s1.k09", "ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.s2.k02", "ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.s4.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.manage", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.409.r001", "ntce.outline.409.r003", "ntce.outline.409.r005", "ntce.outline.409.r006", "ntce.outline.409.r010", "ntce.outline.409.r012", "ntce.outline.409.r018"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.2022a.q32"], "word_count": 287, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "zhengzhi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "081b9980033e9d47fd37d7f84c27fdf5ac75ac8772b577954fd9eb8149bf