{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.2022a.q33.material.recovered", "text": "下面材料是某高校在高三思想政治复习教学中使用的一道测试题。（20分）在外出旅游时，我们既会看到景点的题字，也会看到游人“到此一游”式的涂鸦。图2泰山石刻图3故宫文物上的到此一游有人认为“到此一游”式的涂鸦只是个人行为，影响微不足道。然而在信息技术高度发达的当今社会，一个公民的个人行为往往会被快速传播，无限放大，从而影响世人对国家形象的直观印象。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "081b9980033e9d47fd37d7f84c27fdf5ac75ac8772b577954fd9eb8149bf38aa", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4124, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4297, "next_source_question_number": 34, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 33, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "081b9980033e9d47fd37d7f84c27fdf5ac75ac8772b577954fd9eb8149bf38aa"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.2022a.q33"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.s1.k02", "ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.s1.k03", "ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.s1.k05"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.409.r002"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.2022a.q33"], "word_count": 173, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "zhengzhi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "081b9980033e9d47fd37d7f84c27fdf5ac75ac8772b577954fd9eb8149bf38aa", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4124, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4297, "next_source_question_number": 34, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 33, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "081b9980